---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CourtLine from '../../components/CourtLine.astro';

const updated = 'August 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="What information Courtside Padel collects when you visit the site, how it's used, and what choices you have."
>
  <header class="page-head wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>
  </header>

  <CourtLine />

  <section class="wrap prose">
    <p>
      This policy explains what information Courtside Padel collects when you visit
      this site, how it's used, and what choices you have.
    </p>

    <div class="callout">
      We don't sell your personal data. This site primarily uses standard analytics
      and affiliate tracking, similar to most content websites.
    </div>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Automatically:</strong> pages visited, browser and device type,
        approximate location (via IP), and general usage patterns, collected through
        analytics tools.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Cookies:</strong> used for analytics, remembering preferences, and
        tracking affiliate referrals so partner programs can credit us correctly.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Voluntarily provided:</strong> if you use our contact form, we collect
        the name, email, and message you submit.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use this information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To understand which content is useful and improve the site</li>
      <li>To respond to messages sent through the contact form</li>
      <li>To track affiliate referrals for commission purposes</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Affiliate links and third parties</h2>
    <p>
      This site contains affiliate links to retailers such as PadelNuestro, Casas
      Padel, and Padel And Help. When you click these links, the destination site's
      own privacy policy applies to any data they collect from that point forward —
      we don't control or receive personal data from those transactions.
    </p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>
      You can disable cookies through your browser settings at any time. Doing so may
      affect how some features of the site work, but the site will remain accessible.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy as the site evolves. Material changes will be
      reflected by updating the date at the top of this page.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy can be sent to
      <a href="mailto:hello@courtsidepadel.com">hello@courtsidepadel.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-head {
    padding: 48px var(--gutter) 0;
  }

  .page-head h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 40px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .updated {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted-3);
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  .prose {
    padding: 48px var(--gutter) 72px;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .prose p {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .prose ul {
    margin: 0 0 20px 4px;
  }

  .prose li {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    padding-left: 18px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .prose li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 10px;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--court);
  }

  .prose h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 19px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 32px 0 12px;
  }

  .prose a {
    color: var(--court);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .callout {
    background: #fff;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--court);
    padding: 18px 20px;
    margin: 20px 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
